1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,560
Doctors turned this boy’s ankle

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,090
into a working knee.

3
00:00:03,130 --> 00:00:04,690
Wyatt had bone cancer.

4
00:00:04,730 --> 00:00:06,450
Surgeons had to remove his knee,

5
00:00:06,490 --> 00:00:07,890
but they could save his foot.

6
00:00:07,930 --> 00:00:09,745
They turned his lower leg halfway around

7
00:00:09,785 --> 00:00:11,390
and attached it to his thigh,

8
00:00:11,430 --> 00:00:13,400
with his toes pointing behind him.

9
00:00:13,440 --> 00:00:14,855
That backward ankle now bent

10
00:00:14,895 --> 00:00:16,600
the same way as his other knee.

11
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:17,700
When Wyatt woke up,

12
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:19,500
he could still wiggle his toes.

13
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:20,075
And once he learned

14
00:00:20,115 --> 00:00:21,310
to use his new leg,

15
00:00:21,350 --> 00:00:22,570
that same foot helped him

16
00:00:22,610 --> 00:00:23,850
kick a soccer ball.

